# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Miner build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A 350 KB binary sitting untracked next to its own source is one careless
# 'git add .' away from being committed, and a committed binary is a binary
# nobody can tell you the source of.
miner/wam-miner
miner/build/

# Built by integration/komodo/make_submission.sh. It contains a 400 KB copy
# of KomodoPlatform/coins, which is theirs and would be a merge conflict
# waiting to happen if we kept one. Rebuild it when you submit.
integration/komodo/submission/

# Written by ops/ops.py every minute. It is a cache of what the servers
# said, not a record of anything, and it is different on every machine.
ops/state.json
ops/state.json.tmp
